From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:29:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] CandyOS P28: register the CandyOS wallpaper overlay
 (vendor/candyos)

Appends vendor/candyos/overlay to PRODUCT_PACKAGE_OVERLAYS after the
LineageOS overlays so it has the higher priority: the overlay is
generated in the CandyOS repo from assets/wallpapers/
(scripts/candyos-gen-wallpapers.py) and overrides the framework-res
default wallpaper (drawable-nodpi + sw600dp + sw720dp buckets) with
assets/wallpapers/default.jpg - the CandyOS system default wallpaper.
The overlay directory is vendored into the tree by candyos-sync.sh;
see vendor/candyos/README.md in the CandyOS repo.

Change-Id: Ic293884c587363778ee57bb95a6aee56d72bf006
---
 config/common.mk | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/config/common.mk b/config/common.mk
index d5e1e398..ca768305 100644
--- a/config/common.mk
+++ b/config/common.mk
@@ -256,6 +256,14 @@ CUSTOM_LOCALES += \
 PRODUCT_ENFORCE_RRO_EXCLUDED_OVERLAYS += vendor/crowdin/overlay
 PRODUCT_PACKAGE_OVERLAYS += vendor/crowdin/overlay
 
+# CandyOS: the generated wallpaper overlay (assets/wallpapers/ ->
+# vendor/candyos/overlay, regenerated by scripts/candyos-gen-wallpapers.py
+# in the CandyOS repo). Appended LAST so it outranks the LineageOS overlays
+# above - it overrides the framework-res default wallpaper (all three
+# density buckets) with assets/wallpapers/default.jpg. See
+# vendor/candyos/README.md in the CandyOS repo.
+PRODUCT_PACKAGE_OVERLAYS += vendor/candyos/overlay
+
 PRODUCT_EXTRA_RECOVERY_KEYS += \
     vendor/lineage/build/target/product/security/lineage
 
